---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs component and device tests with retained failure artifacts

Usage: leptoskit test <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run   Runs a compiled test executable and retains its logs and JSON report
  web   Runs browser component tests through wasm-bindgen-test
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
